(7505119, 1196455, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok. For the most part, I think that photos should be self-explanatory. So I''m terrible, and most time, I don''t bother reading titles. And if the title has to explain the photo, I''m not that sympathetic. Curious, most times, because titles are art museums, etc., can really put things into perspective. But many times on DPC, they''re just trying to explain a real leap of faith. <br/> <br/>But here''s what I went through with this photo:<br/> <br/>1. Great photo. Whether it''s the photo or the processing, it''s a truly excellent job of isolating the person and really having him stand out. His look is wonderfully enigmatic. It looks curious yet disdainful, or is it just intense? There''s a little bit of something negative in it, yet not overtly.<br/> <br/>2. Don''t see how it fits the challenge at all. Crap. I liked the photo.<br/> <br/>3. Read the title. Another one of the square pegs into a round hole.<br/> <br/>4. I see the button! The papers in the hand, the look on the face, it''s all coming into focus.<br/> <br/>4. Hey wait! That''s not a square peg at all!<br/> <br/>5. Holy crap. Even though the challenge description specifically states men and woman, you can''t get much more of a fit for battle and sex and the whole topic.<br/> <br/>6. Excellent choice. Wonderful shot. I hope you get more people taking a second look and thinking things through. 8 for the photo. +1 for the fit. +1 for making me stop and think and realize how easy it is to pass something by. First 10 I''ve given in a long time.</td>', 'Ok. For the most part, I think that photos should be self-explanatory. So I''m terrible, and most time, I don''t bother reading titles. And if the title has to explain the photo, I''m not that sympathetic. Curious, most times, because titles are art museums, etc., can really put things into perspective. But many times on DPC, they''re just trying to explain a real leap of faith.  But here''s what I went through with this photo: 1. Great photo. Whether it''s the photo or the processing, it''s a truly excellent job of isolating the person and really having him stand out. His look is wonderfully enigmatic. It looks curious yet disdainful, or is it just intense? There''s a little bit of something negative in it, yet not overtly. 2. Don''t see how it fits the challenge at all. Crap. I liked the photo. 3. Read the title. Another one of the square pegs into a round hole. 4. I see the button! The papers in the hand, the look on the face, it''s all coming into focus. 4. Hey wait! That''s not a square peg at all! 5. Holy crap. Even though the challenge description specifically states men and woman, you can''t get much more of a fit for battle and sex and the whole topic. 6. Excellent choice. Wonderful shot. I hope you get more people taking a second look and thinking things through. 8 for the photo. +1 for the fit. +1 for making me stop and think and realize how easy it is to pass something by. First 10 I''ve given in a long time.', '2017-03-13 14:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7505120, 1196292, 103142, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s a battle, but it''s a tremendous find. I love her look. I love his look that looks rather smug and superior. I love that you cut off his foot. Because I would have probably tried to put it in, because so many times we''re told that cutting something off is distracting. But the dynamics and the proportions would have been all wrong if you had. And this shows how perfectly it can work. 7 for a great find. + another 1 for teaching me something.<br/> <br/>Oh heck. It''s better than that. -9-</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s a battle, but it''s a tremendous find. I love her look. I love his look that looks rather smug and superior. I love that you cut off his foot. Because I would have probably tried to put it in, because so many times we''re told that cutting something off is distracting. But the dynamics and the proportions would have been all wrong if you had. And this shows how perfectly it can work. 7 for a great find. + another 1 for teaching me something. Oh heck. It''s better than that. -9-', '2017-03-13 14:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7505121, 1196478, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one where I don''t know if it''s really a battle. But a great find, I good capture in a difficult space. And great processing. -8-</td>', 'Another one where I don''t know if it''s really a battle. But a great find, I good capture in a difficult space. And great processing. -8-', '2017-03-13 14:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7505122, 1195994, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that says so much with the title and the photo combined. At first I figured you were talking about the man next to her, and I was thinking that it was a rather self righteous title (whether true or not, I didn''t know) But then I saw the guy walking by and drinking. Now it may not be a large starbucks that he''s drinking. It''s a pretty small cup. But it started me thinking just how much we spend on frivolous drinks. I love the multiple levels of thought that this brought me through. -8-</td>', 'Another one that says so much with the title and the photo combined. At first I figured you were talking about the man next to her, and I was thinking that it was a rather self righteous title (whether true or not, I didn''t know) But then I saw the guy walking by and drinking. Now it may not be a large starbucks that he''s drinking. It''s a pretty small cup. But it started me thinking just how much we spend on frivolous drinks. I love the multiple levels of thought that this brought me through. -8-', '2017-03-13 14:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7505123, 1195944, 103142, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2017-03-13 14:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
