(7505338, 1196478, 19825, '<td valign="top">Well suited to the challenge and nicely spotted and processed. I think a little healthy competition is not a bad thing. I think often the issue (IMHO) is that women have been denied the opportunity to compete. Congrats on the unexpected ribbon.</td>', 'Well suited to the challenge and nicely spotted and processed. I think a little healthy competition is not a bad thing. I think often the issue (IMHO) is that women have been denied the opportunity to compete. Congrats on the unexpected ribbon.', '2017-03-15 15:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7505339, 1196360, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot. Nicely done. It is a strong image and, based upon that alone, I think it should have finished higher. However, take it from someone that has entered a few shots this year taken at protests, you are bound to get some votes that are affected by the voter''s political biases no matter how good they are photographically.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot. Nicely done. It is a strong image and, based upon that alone, I think it should have finished higher. However, take it from someone that has entered a few shots this year taken at protests, you are bound to get some votes that are affected by the voter''s political biases no matter how good they are photographically.', '2017-03-15 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
