(7505367, 1196360, 59029, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> How did this have anything to do with Battle of the Sexes? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Uhmmm...because your new president seems to be a racist and misogynistic pig? Younger black woman vs elderly white male?  Figure it out.</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: How did this have anything to do with Battle of the Sexes?   Uhmmm...because your new president seems to be a racist and misogynistic pig? Younger black woman vs elderly white male?  Figure it out.', '2017-03-15 21:50:33.000000', NULL, 0),
